| Column                      | Meaning                                       |
| --------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |
| Asset ID                    | Unique identifier (A01, A02, etc.)            |
| Asset Name                  | System/service name                           |
| Asset Type                  | Technical / Data / Human / Vendor             |
| Description                 | What it does                                  |
| Owner                       | Who is responsible (role, not name)           |
| Data Classification         | Public / Internal / Confidential / Restricted |
| Availability Criticality    | Low / Medium / High                           |
| Confidentiality Criticality | Low / Medium / High                           |
| Integrity Criticality       | Low / Medium / High                           |
| Dependencies                | Related assets                                |
| Notes                       | Anything relevant                             |

